<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight rates narrow, one-week up.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight rates narrow, one-week up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound narrowed on Tuesday in the private-sector market to a range of between 7-1/2 and 8-1/2 percent, from seven and 8-1/2 percent on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said one-week rates rose to between 7-1/2 and 8-3/4 percent from between seven and 8-1/2 on Monday.</p>
<p>Public sector banks maintained their 10-1/2 percent rate.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
